      "definition": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.auth_company_id()\n RETURNS uuid\n LANGUAGE sql\n STABLE SECURITY DEFINER\n SET search_path TO 'public'\nAS $function$\r\n  SELECT company_id\r\n  FROM company_users\r\n  WHERE user_id = auth.uid()\r\n  LIMIT 1;\r\n$function$\n",
